WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:04.200
A ride begins before anyone gets into a car.

2
00:00:04.630 --> 00:00:06.530
Two people. Different needs.

3
00:00:07.210 --> 00:00:08.470
Conditions of their own.

4
00:00:12.250 --> 00:00:15.250
The passenger has set her budget and pickup
preferences.

5
00:00:15.850 --> 00:00:17.660
The driver has chosen where to work

6
00:00:17.690 --> 00:00:19.770
and the terms he accepts.

7
00:00:20.210 --> 00:00:22.200
Each has already authorized an application

8
00:00:22.230 --> 00:00:24.450
to act within those limits.

9
00:00:26.350 --> 00:00:31.122
A shared alias helps the application find
nearby drivers.

10
00:00:31.933 --> 00:00:35.045
It establishes relationships with the
participants.

11
00:00:35.933 --> 00:00:39.312
One request then reaches them through
multicast.

12
00:00:41.933 --> 00:00:44.170
Across thousands of possible drivers,

13
00:00:44.170 --> 00:00:47.750
those available for this journey return
their quotes.

14
00:00:48.558 --> 00:00:53.272
The application compares the offers within
the passenger’s saved preferences.

15
00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:56.780
There is no central dispatcher.

16
00:00:57.140 --> 00:00:59.880
Their applications work out the ride
directly,

17
00:01:00.300 --> 00:01:03.380
within the conditions each person has
already chosen.

18
00:01:03.740 --> 00:01:05.840
When compatible terms are found,

19
00:01:06.060 --> 00:01:08.060
the agreement forms automatically.

20
00:01:08.580 --> 00:01:11.000
The scheduled pickup appears for the driver.

21
00:01:11.420 --> 00:01:13.420
No extra acceptance step.

22
00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:16.260
The car arrives.

23
00:01:16.560 --> 00:01:18.510
A greeting, an open door,

24
00:01:18.540 --> 00:01:19.760
and the journey begins.

25
00:01:20.260 --> 00:01:22.140
The agreement serves the people,

26
00:01:22.220 --> 00:01:23.800
not the other way around.

27
00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:34.830
PRP provides the foundation

28
00:01:34.860 --> 00:01:37.220
for communication between participants.

29
00:01:37.660 --> 00:01:41.240
The application defines how offers and
agreements work.

30
00:01:41.480 --> 00:01:43.720
People choose their tools and conditions;

31
00:01:44.220 --> 00:01:47.140
compatible applications coordinate the
journey.

32
00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:51.550
People set the conditions.

33
00:01:54.720 --> 00:01:56.050
Applications find agreement.

34
00:01:56.240 --> 00:01:57.780
Life moves forward.

35
00:01:59.650 --> 00:02:01.190
Built on PRP.
